msgstr "电话"

#: includes/admin/class-apps-page.php:188
msgid ""
"Phones have no mouse, so these signals are used instead. Tick several to catch more visitors:\n"
"Back button: when the visitor presses back (for example to return to the Google results), the popup shows first. It only catches back once – pressing back again leaves – and lets it through when the popup cannot show. It starts after the visitor has tapped the page once (Chrome requires this). Ad reviewers may look closely at pages that react to the back button.\n"
"Quick scroll back up: scrolled down to read, then flicks back up – usually towards the address bar or back.\n"
"Comes back after switching away: went to another app or tab for a few seconds and came back.\n"
"No activity: nothing touched for the set time.\n"
"Reaches the bottom of the page: has seen everything on the page.\n"
"Works in Chrome, Safari, Firefox and the phone’s own browser. The popup starts after the page has loaded, so a visitor who leaves right away may not see it."
msgstr ""
"手机没有鼠标，所以改用下面这些信号。多勾几种能挽回更多访客：\n"
"点击“返回”按钮：访客按返回（例如回到 Google 搜索结果）时先弹窗。只拦一次，再按返回就正常离开；弹窗不能弹时直接放行。访客点过一次页面之后才生效（Chrome 的要求）。广告审核可能会留意对返回键有反应的页面。\n"
"快速上滑：往下看了一段后又快速往上滑，通常是要去地址栏或返回。\n"
"切走后又回来：切到别的 App 或标签页几秒后又回到这一页。\n"
"无操作：在设定时间内没有任何触摸。\n"
"看到页面底部：已经把整页看完了。\n"
"支持谷歌、Safari、火狐和手机自带的浏览器。弹窗在页面加载完成后才开始工作，访客打开后马上离开时可能不会触发。"

