#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:147
msgid "Admin email"
msgstr "管理员邮箱"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:147
msgid ""
"We use the admin email to contact you and to send order notifications (admin emails such as new orders go here unless you set other recipients). Make sure it is correct so you do not miss anything.\n"
"Changing it sends a confirmation link to the new address; the change takes effect after the link is opened."
msgstr ""
"我们将通过你提供的管理员邮箱与你取得联系或发送订单通知（新订单等管理员邮件默认发到这里，除非另外设置了收件人）。请确保填写准确的邮箱信息，以便我们能够及时与你沟通。\n"
"修改后会向新邮箱发送确认链接，打开链接后才生效。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:148
msgid "Support email (important)"
msgstr "客服邮箱（重要）"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:148
msgid "Sender address of all store emails (order emails, cart reminders). Use an address on your own domain so emails are not marked as spam."
msgstr "店铺所有邮件（订单邮件、弃单提醒）的发件地址。请使用你自己域名下的邮箱，避免被当成垃圾邮件。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:149
msgid "Support name"
msgstr "客服名称"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:149
