msgstr "发送邮件的发件人名称，为空则默认“店铺名称”"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:149
msgid "The sender shown in store emails, so customers can tell where the email comes from."
msgstr "发送邮件中显示的发件人信息，便于顾客识别邮件的来源。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:157
msgid "Website favicon"
msgstr "网站 Favicon"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:157
msgid "The small icon shown in the browser tab and bookmarks. Usually 32×32 px; use png, svg or ico so browsers show it correctly."
msgstr "Favicon 是网站的缩略标识，显示在浏览器标签页和收藏夹里，一般为 32×32 像素。请使用 png、svg 或 ico 格式，浏览器才能正常显示。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:158
msgid "Finance email"
msgstr "财务邮箱"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:158
msgid "Receives payment alerts such as possible duplicate payments. Empty uses the admin email."
msgstr "接收付款相关提醒，例如疑似重复付款。为空时发到管理员邮箱。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:170
msgid "Basic"
msgstr "基础设置"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:171
msgid "Store currency"
msgstr "店铺货币"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:171
msgid "The store currency cannot be changed after orders exist."
msgstr "店铺货币在产生订单后无法修改。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:172
msgid "Generate SPU codes automatically"
msgstr "自动生成 SPU 编码"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:172
msgid "Random code (18 digits)"
msgstr "独立随机编码（18 位数字）"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:172
msgid "Same as product ID (auto-increment number)"
msgstr "同商品 ID（自增数字）"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:172
msgid ""
"When you have not set an SPU yourself, the system generates one (it identifies the product uniquely in this store). This applies to new products (including imports) and to edited products.\n"
"You can also type an SPU on the product edit page; existing codes are kept."
msgstr ""
"当商家未手动定义 SPU 编码时，系统将自动生成 SPU 编码（用于标识商品在当前店铺内的唯一性），该机制适用于新增商品（包括导入等方式）及编辑商品场景。\n"
"也可以在商品编辑页手动填写 SPU；已有的编码不会改变。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:176
msgid "Custom (kept as is)"
msgstr "自定义（保持不变）"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:178
msgid "Currency format"
msgstr "货币格式"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:178
msgid "Thousands separator, decimal separator and number of decimals in prices."
msgstr "价格的千位分隔符、小数点和小数位数。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:180
msgid "Same in storefront and admin: smart search (2 words or fewer must all match; more than that, 80% of the words)"
msgstr "前后台一致，均智能搜索（不足 2 个词则全包含，超过则 80% 匹配）"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:181
msgid "Same in storefront and admin: every word must be in the title"
msgstr "前后台一致，均需包含全部词"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:182
msgid "Smart search in the storefront; WooCommerce’s own search in admin"
msgstr "前台智能搜索，后台使用 WooCommerce 原有搜索"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:184
msgid "Product title search"
msgstr "商品标题搜索方式"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:184
msgid "How product titles are matched by the storefront search and by the admin product search. SKUs (and the storefront search fields below) are matched as well."
msgstr "设置前台消费者和后台管理员的商品标题搜索方式。SKU（以及下面的前台搜索字段）也会一起匹配。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:185
msgid "Admin login security check"
msgstr "后台登录验证码"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:185
msgid "Stops programs from guessing admin logins automatically: the WordPress login page asks a simple math question."
msgstr "防止被计算机程序自动识别登录信息，确保登录系统安全：WordPress 登录页会出一道简单的算术题。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:190
msgid "Other crawlers: one User-Agent keyword per line, e.g. examplebot"
msgstr "其他爬虫：每行一个 User-Agent 关键词，例如 examplebot"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:191
msgid "Block crawlers"
msgstr "禁止爬虫访问"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:191
msgid ""
"Choose which internet crawlers may not crawl your store. Ticked crawlers get a 403 page, and a Disallow line is added to robots.txt.\n"
"Blocking Googlebot or Bingbot removes the store from that search engine; blocking Meta / Facebook stops link previews on Facebook and Instagram."
msgstr ""
"管理互联网爬虫是否允许爬取网站相关信息，勾选后将不允许选中的爬虫访问网站：勾选的爬虫会收到 403 页面，并写进 robots.txt。\n"
"屏蔽 Googlebot 或 Bingbot 会让店铺从对应的搜索引擎消失；屏蔽 Meta / Facebook 会让 Facebook 和 Instagram 无法显示链接预览。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:198
msgid "Time zone"
msgstr "时区"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:198
msgid "Used for order times and the dashboard (“today” starts at midnight in this time zone)."
msgstr "用于订单时间和仪表盘（“今天”从这个时区的 0 点开始）。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:200
msgid "Do not generate"
msgstr "不自动生成"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:200
msgid "Generate"
msgstr "自动生成"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:201
msgid "Generate SKU codes automatically"
msgstr "自动生成 SKU 编码"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:201
msgid ""
"When on, SKUs are created for new, duplicated, edited and imported products that have no SKU yet.\n"
"Variations use the pattern ({SKU_CODE} is the variation number 01, 02, …). A product with a single variation has no variation part: its SKU is the SPU."
msgstr ""
"开启自动生成 SKU 编码，在新增、复制、编辑、导入商品时，对还没有 SKU 的商品生效。\n"
"多款式商品的款式按格式生成（{SKU_CODE} 是款式序号 01、02……）；单规格商品没有款式部分，SKU 就是 SPU。"

#. translators: %d: number of hours
#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:205
#, php-format
msgid "%d hour"
msgid_plural "%d hours"
msgstr[0] "%d 小时"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:207
msgid "Returning visitor rule"
msgstr "回访用户计算时间"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:207
msgid "Visitors who come back more than"
msgstr "用户再次访问网站超过"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:207
msgid "after their first visit count as returning"
msgstr "标记为老用户"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:207
msgid ""
"1. Separates new visitors from returning visitors (used by “Returning visitors” on the dashboard).\n"
"2. A returning visitor visits the store again, e.g. more than 1 day after the first visit.\n"
"3. Calculation: (end of the first visit’s day, 23:59:59, minus the visit time) + the returning time; in other words the next visit must come after the end of the first day plus this time.\n"
"4. Keep one store time zone; changing it often makes the numbers less accurate."
msgstr ""
"1. 区分现有用户和回访用户（用于仪表盘的“回访用户”）。\n"
"2. 回访用户指再次访问网站的用户，例如：其访问间隔超过 1 天记为回访用户。\n"
"3. 计算方式：{零点时间（23:59:59）- 访问时间} + 回访用户的计算时间，也就是下次访问要在第一次访问当天结束之后，再过这段时间。\n"
"4. 尽量使用统一的店铺时区，避免频繁切换时区导致的误差。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:208
msgid "Anti-crawler / high-risk IP limit"
msgstr "防爬 / 高风险 IP 限制"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:208
msgid ""
"1. When on, the system blocks unfriendly crawlers and security scanners from visiting your store (the built-in list below).\n"
"2. When off, they are allowed, e.g. while you temporarily run a scanning tool on your store.\n"
"High-risk IP detection needs an IP reputation service and is not available on this site; blocking works by crawler name."
msgstr ""
"1. 开启时，系统将屏蔽不友好爬虫和安全扫描器访问你的店铺（即下面的系统内置名单），保护安全。\n"
"2. 关闭时，将允许上述爬虫访问，适用于允许扫描工具访问店铺等临时场景。\n"
"高风险 IP 识别需要 IP 信誉服务，本站暂不提供，目前按爬虫名称屏蔽。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:210
msgid "System crawler block"
msgstr "系统禁止爬虫访问"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:210
msgid "These crawlers are blocked at system level and cannot be edited; they are switched on and off with “Anti-crawler / high-risk IP limit” above."
msgstr "以下爬虫是系统级限制，不可编辑；由上面的“防爬 / 高风险 IP 限制”统一开关。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:228
#: includes/class-coupons.php:581
msgid "Storefront"
msgstr "网站展示"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:229
msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:229
msgid "Language of the storefront texts provided by WordPress, WooCommerce and this plugin. Your own admin language is set in your profile."
msgstr "前台由 WordPress、WooCommerce 和本插件提供的文字所用的语言。你自己的后台语言在个人资料里设置。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:230
msgid "Product title"
msgstr "商品标题"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:231
msgid "SKU"
msgstr "SKU"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:231
#: includes/modules/class-registry.php:1181
msgid "Category"
msgstr "分类"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:231
msgid "Tag"
msgstr "标签"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:235
msgid "Storefront search fields"
msgstr "前台搜索字段"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:235
msgid ""
"What the storefront product search matches. The product title is always searched (see “Product title search”).\n"
"SKU also matches variation SKUs; category and tag match their names."
msgstr ""
"前台商品搜索匹配哪些内容。商品标题总会被搜索（见“商品标题搜索方式”）。\n"
"SKU 包括款式的 SKU；分类和标签按名称匹配。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:236
msgid "Require sign-in to visit the store"
msgstr "前台访问是否强制注册 / 登录"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:236
#: includes/admin/class-coupons-page.php:222
#: includes/admin/class-list-columns.php:71
#: includes/admin/class-list-columns.php:118
#: includes/admin/class-shipping-discounts-page.php:119
#: includes/admin/class-tax-page.php:70
#: includes/admin/class-list-columns.php:62
#: includes/admin/class-list-columns.php:109
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:236
#: includes/admin/class-coupons-page.php:222
#: includes/admin/class-shipping-discounts-page.php:119
#: includes/admin/class-tax-page.php:70
msgid "No"
msgstr "否"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:236
msgid ""
"When on, visitors must register or sign in before they can see any page of the store (the account page, privacy policy and checkout terms pages stay open).\n"
"New accounts are disabled until you approve them under Users. Suitable for members-only or private stores; not recommended for stores that run traffic campaigns, because it lowers conversion."
msgstr ""
"开启强制注册 / 登录，前台用户访问网站任何页面均需要注册登录后才能访问（账户页、隐私政策和结账条款页面仍然公开）。\n"
"新注册用户默认为禁用，需在后台“用户”里批准后才可正常使用。适用于强会员制、老客私域运营的网站；大量投放引流的网站不建议开启，以免影响流量转化。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:242
msgid "Storefront sort options"
msgstr "前台排序字段"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:242
msgid ""
"Controls the sort options customers can choose on product lists (shop, category pages, search results).\n"
"Ticked options appear in the sort menu; drag to change the order. The first one is the default sort, so put “Recommended” first to keep your own product order."
msgstr ""
"控制商品列表页（商店、分类页、搜索结果页等）可选的商品排序方式。\n"
"勾选的选项会出现在排序菜单里，拖动可调整顺序；排在第一的是默认排序，想保持自己设定的商品顺序，请把“综合推荐”置顶。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:243
msgid "Allow the store in an iframe"
msgstr "允许 iframe 加载网站"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:243
msgid "When on, other websites may load your store inside an inline frame (iframe). When off, they cannot, which protects against clickjacking."
msgstr "开启后，即允许其他网站以“内联框架”（iframe）的形式加载当前网站；关闭时不允许，可以防止点击劫持。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:251
msgid "Custom (set in Settings → Permalinks)"
msgstr "自定义（在“设置 → 固定链接”中设置）"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:253
msgid "Product link structure"
msgstr "商品链接结构"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:253
msgid ""
"Controls the levels in product page addresses, e.g. shortening /shop/category/name to /product/name.\n"
"Changing it changes the address of every product page and old links stop working, so decide before you promote the store."
msgstr ""
"控制商品链接的层级结构，例如：将商品页链接从“/shop/分类/名称”简化为“/product/名称”。\n"
"修改后所有商品页的地址都会改变，旧链接会失效，请在推广店铺之前确定。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:255
msgid "Show the 404 page"
msgstr "404 页面"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:256
msgid "Visible but not purchasable"
msgstr "可见但不可购买"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:257
msgid "Visible and purchasable"
msgstr "可见且可购买"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:258
msgid "Go to the home page"
msgstr "跳转到首页"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:259
msgid "Go to the shop page"
msgstr "跳转到商店页"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:261
msgid "Product page of an unpublished product"
msgstr "商品详情页，已下架商品展示"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:261
msgid ""
"For products set to draft (unpublished):\n"
"404 page: customers cannot see the product.\n"
"Visible but not purchasable: the product page shows, sales are paused.\n"
"Visible and purchasable: the product page shows and it can be bought while in stock; for products sold only through a direct link.\n"
"Note: this only affects the product page (which is kept out of search engines); product lists always hide unpublished products. Private products and products in the trash always show the 404 page."
msgstr ""
"针对已下架（草稿）的商品：\n"
"404 页面：用户无法查看商品信息。\n"
"可见但不可购买：展示商品信息，但暂停销售。\n"
"可见且可购买：展示商品信息，且满足库存时可购买商品；适用于需要通过独立推广链接或输入商品链接才能购买的场景。\n"
"注：以上配置仅影响商品详情页（页面不让搜索引擎收录），商品列表会自动隐藏已下架商品。私密商品和回收站里的商品始终显示 404。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:263
msgid "Storefront security check"
msgstr "前台图形验证码"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:263
msgid "Adds a simple math question to the login and registration forms on the account page, to stop programs from signing up or guessing passwords automatically."
msgstr "在“我的账户”的登录和注册表单加一道简单的算术题，防止程序自动注册或猜密码。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:264
msgid "Registration on the account page is currently turned off (WooCommerce settings → Accounts & Privacy)."
msgstr "账户页注册目前是关闭的（WooCommerce 设置 → 账户与隐私）。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:266
msgid "The “Registration email verification” email is turned off, so verification is skipped."
msgstr "“注册邮箱验证”邮件已关闭，所以不会要求验证。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:266
#: includes/admin/class-email-center.php:152
#: includes/admin/class-store-settings.php:62
msgid "Email notifications"
msgstr "邮件通知"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:268
msgid "Register email verification"
msgstr "注册邮箱验证"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:268
msgid ""
"1. When on, new customers who register must confirm their email through a link before they can sign in, which keeps accounts genuine. Accounts created during checkout are not affected.\n"
"2. The “Registration email verification” email must be on in Email notifications."
msgstr ""
"1. 开启后，前台新用户注册时需要通过邮件里的链接验证邮箱后才能登录，验证邮件真实性以保证账户安全。结账时创建的账户不受影响。\n"
"2. 使用此功能时，请在【邮件通知】板块中开启“注册邮箱验证”邮件。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:269
msgid "Store status"
msgstr "店铺经营状态"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:269
msgid "Open"
msgstr "营业中"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:269
msgid ""
"1. Set the store to Closed before you officially open, or when you need to close the storefront for a while; set it back to Open to resume.\n"
"2. While Closed, visitors see a “coming soon” page. You still see the storefront when signed in as admin; to see what visitors see, use another browser or a private window."
msgstr ""
"1. 若你希望在正式经营前或暂时需要关闭店铺前台，可以将店铺设置为“打烊”状态；如果需要恢复运营，再将经营状态设置为“营业中”即可。\n"
"2. 打烊时访客看到“即将上线”页面。以管理员身份登录时仍能看到前台；如需预览访客看到的效果，可更换浏览器或使用无痕窗口。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:271
msgid "First available variation"
msgstr "第一个有货的款式"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:272
msgid "Lowest price"
msgstr "价格最低"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:273
msgid "Highest price"
msgstr "价格最高"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:274
msgid "Most stock"
msgstr "库存最多"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:275
msgid "None selected"
msgstr "不选中"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:277
msgid "Default variation on product pages"
msgstr "多款式商品默认选中"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:277
msgid ""
"1. Select a variation by default:\n"
"• First available: the first variation that can be bought, for a quick decision.\n"
"• Lowest price: the cheapest available variation, for price-sensitive buyers.\n"
"• Highest price: the most expensive available variation.\n"
"• Most stock: the available variation with the most stock, to lower the risk of running out.\n"
"2. None selected: customers must choose themselves; when they try to buy without choosing, they are asked to select one.\n"
"3. Used on product pages when the product has no default variation of its own."
msgstr ""
"1. 默认选中 SKU：\n"
"• 首个 SKU：默认选中第一个可售 SKU，减少选择困惑，引导快速决策。\n"
"• 价格最低：默认选中价格最低的可售 SKU，帮助用户快速锁定性价比。\n"
"• 价格最高：默认选中价格最高的可售 SKU，满足高端需求用户。\n"
"• 库存最多：默认选中库存最多的可售 SKU，降低缺货风险，提升成功率。\n"
"2. 不默认选中：默认不选中任何 SKU，避免用户误操作；用户未选择就购买时，会提示先选择款式。\n"
"3. 适用范围：商品自己没有设置默认款式时的商品详情页。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:278
msgid "Sold-out variations on product pages"
msgstr "商品详情页，已售罄的款式"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:278
#: includes/admin/class-design-editor.php:155
#: includes/modules/class-blocks.php:235
msgid "Show"
msgstr "显示"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:278
#: includes/admin/class-design-editor.php:154
#: includes/modules/class-blocks.php:234
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "隐藏"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:278
msgid "Choose whether sold-out variations are shown. Example: every size of “yellow” is in stock, but “red” in XL is sold out. With Hide, a customer who switches to red cannot select XL."
msgstr "选择是否显示已售罄的款式。例如，商品颜色“yellow”的所有尺码都有货，而颜色“red”的 XL 尺码已售罄；设置为隐藏时，用户切换到“red”颜色后无法选择 XL。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:284
msgid "Select a country"
msgstr "选择国家"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:287
#: includes/admin/class-email-center.php:219
#: includes/admin/class-recovery-page.php:144
msgid "Public contact information"
msgstr "公开联系方式"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:287
msgid ""
"Optional. When filled in it helps buyers contact you, is output as JSON-LD structured data (Organization) on the home page, and can be used in terms pages through [pc_var].\n"
"Country, state, city, address and ZIP are the WooCommerce store address. US law requires a physical address in marketing emails, so cart reminders are only sent after the address is filled in."
msgstr ""
"可留空。填写之后方便买家联系，会以 JSON-LD 结构化数据（Organization）输出在首页，条款页面也可以用 [pc_var] 引用。\n"
"国家、州、市、地址和邮编就是 WooCommerce 的店铺地址。美国法律要求营销邮件写明实体地址，所以填写地址后才会发送弃单提醒。"

