msgstr "请输入电话"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:307
msgid "Temporary domain access and its password"
msgstr "临时域名访问店铺 / 临时域名访问密码"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:307
msgid "Shopname’s free temporary domain. This store runs on its own domain; use “Store status → Closed” to hide the store before opening."
msgstr "Shopname 的免费临时域名。本站使用自己的域名；开业前想隐藏店铺，可以把“店铺经营状态”设为打烊。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:308
msgid "Home and collection page cache time"
msgstr "首页和专辑详情页缓存时间"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:308
msgid "There is no page cache layer in this WordPress setup yet. When the store goes live, caching is set up at the hosting or with a cache plugin."
msgstr "本站目前没有页面缓存层。正式上线时由主机或缓存插件配置缓存。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:309
msgid "Ad pixel delay compensation"
msgstr "广告像素延迟补偿"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:309
msgid "Ad pixels (Facebook, TikTok, Snapchat, Pinterest) are not connected yet; this belongs to the “Ad pixels” card."
msgstr "还没有接入广告像素（Facebook、TikTok、Snapchat、Pinterest），属于“广告像素”卡片。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:310
