#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:313
msgid "Product page: deleted variation combinations"
msgstr "商品详情页，已删除的款式"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:313
msgid "The variation picker on product pages is part of the theme; this needs the theme (Codex) to support it."
msgstr "商品详情页的款式选择器属于主题，需要主题（Codex）配合才能做。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:314
