msgstr "管理员邮箱格式不正确。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:371
msgid "Choose a city-based time zone (for example Los Angeles), so daylight saving time is handled."
msgstr "请选择按城市命名的时区（例如洛杉矶），这样夏令时会自动处理。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:383
msgid "The support email is not valid."
msgstr "客服邮箱格式不正确。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:388
msgid "The finance email is not valid."
msgstr "财务邮箱格式不正确。"

#: includes/admin/class-basic-config-page.php:413
msgid "Keep at least one sort option."
msgstr "至少保留一个排序选项。"

#: includes/admin/class-batch-metabox.php:29
