msgstr "3–40 个字符：字母、数字和连字符。保存时统一转为大写，且不能与其他批次重复。"

#: includes/admin/class-batch-metabox.php:56
#: includes/admin/class-list-columns.php:42
#: includes/admin/class-marketing.php:262
