#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:185
msgid "Server-side sends"
msgstr "服务端回传记录"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:185
msgid "Events sent by the server to Facebook (Conversions API) and TikTok (Events API) for pixels with an access token. Kept for 7 days. Browser events can be checked in each platform’s own test tool (for example Meta Events Manager → Test events)."
msgstr "填了 access token 的像素，由服务器发给 Facebook（Conversions API）和 TikTok（Events API）的事件，保留 7 天。浏览器端的事件请在各平台自己的测试工具里查看（例如 Meta 事件管理工具 → 测试事件）。"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:187
msgid "Nothing sent yet."
msgstr "还没有发送记录。"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:189
msgid "Platform"
msgstr "平台"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:197
#: includes/admin/class-seo-page.php:169
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "备注说明"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:198
msgid "A pixel is a piece of JavaScript in the page. It sends what visitors do (views, add to cart, orders) to the ad platform’s servers so the platform can count the results of your ads."
msgstr "通过在网页中嵌入一段 JS 代码，这段代码会把访客的浏览、加购、下单等行为发送给广告平台的服务器，用来统计广告效果。"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:199
msgid "With the pixel of an ad platform installed you can measure, analyse, retarget and build audiences on that platform. With an access token the server also sends the same events, which fills in what ad blockers and phone privacy settings remove; both carry the same event ID so the platform counts them once."
msgstr "安装对应的广告像素代码，有助于广告平台进行数据统计、数据分析、实现再营销、精准定位受众人群等功能。填了 access token 时服务器也会回传一份，补上被拦截插件和手机隐私设置挡掉的数据；两份事件编号相同，平台只算一次。"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:200
msgid "The numbers in the ad platform and on the site can differ somewhat; this is normal."
msgstr "广告平台数据与网站数据，可能存在一定程度的数据误差，属于正常情况。"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:201
msgid "Visitors who send the browser “Global Privacy Control” signal, or open any page with ?pc_px_optout=1, are not reported. Mention the platforms you use in your privacy policy."
msgstr "发出浏览器“全局隐私控制（GPC）”信号的访客，或者打开过带 ?pc_px_optout=1 的页面的访客，不会被回传。请在隐私政策里写明用了哪些广告平台。"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:207
msgid "Respect the browser’s Global Privacy Control (GPC) signal"
msgstr "遵守浏览器的“全局隐私控制（GPC）”信号"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:207
msgid "California and several other US states treat a GPC signal as a request not to sell or share the visitor’s data. On: no pixels and no server-side events for these visitors."
msgstr "加利福尼亚等美国州把 GPC 信号视为“不要出售或分享我的数据”的请求。勾选：这些访客不加载像素，也不做服务端回传。"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:208
msgid "Advanced matching: send the known email and phone as SHA-256 hashes"
msgstr "高级匹配：把已知的邮箱和电话加密成 SHA-256 哈希后回传"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:208
msgid "Helps the platforms recognise the customer. The values are hashed before they leave the site and cannot be read back."
msgstr "帮助平台认出顾客。资料在离开网站之前就已经加密，无法还原。"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:209
msgid "Also report staff visits (for testing)"
msgstr "员工访问也回传（测试用）"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:210
msgid "Also send PageView from the server"
msgstr "服务端也回传 PageView"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:210
msgid "Off by default: every page view would then also become a server request to the platform."
msgstr "默认关闭：打开后每次浏览页面都会多一次服务器请求。"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:211
msgid "When the pixels load"
msgstr "像素加载时机"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:211
msgid "When the page has loaded"
msgstr "页面加载完成后"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:211
msgid "At the first scroll or tap (faster pages, a few page views may be missed)"
msgstr "访客第一次滚动或点击时（页面更快，可能漏掉少量浏览）"

