msgid "Facebook test event code"
msgstr "Facebook 测试事件代码"

#: includes/admin/class-pixels-page.php:212
msgid "From Meta Events Manager → Test events. While it is filled in, server-side events show up there. Clear it when you are done testing."
msgstr "在 Meta 事件管理工具 → 测试事件里获取。填了以后服务端事件会显示在那里，测试完请清空。"

