msgid "Visitors, funnel and chart use visits that started in this period. A visitor counts once in the period and once in each chart bucket they visited. Page views use event time. Paid orders use creation time, exclude test orders and subtract current refunds. Completed payment counts visitors in the funnel, and orders in the cards."
